Project Testing Phase

The testing phase is conducted to ensure that the EduGenie system works correctly, reliably, and efficiently. All major features are tested to identify and fix errors before deployment.

Test the Google Gemini AI integration and responses.

Verify user login and authentication.

Test learning assistance and question-answer features.

Check the user interface and navigation.

Test the system on different devices and screen sizes.

Identify and fix bugs and performance issues.

Conduct final validation to ensure the project meets all requirements.
